 "remarks": "TURNKEY INCOME-PRODUCING ASSET + VALUE-ADD OPPORTUNITY IN STAMFORD'S DESIRABLE BULLS HEAD! Just minutes from Downtown Stamford, 109 Oaklawn Ave is a rare legal 2-unit property plus In-Law Apartment offering strong income, modern updates and exceptional future potential. Unit 1 features 3 Bedrooms, 1.5 Baths, spacious Living Room, Eat-in Kitchen and Primary Bedroom with en-suite Half Bath. Unit 2 offers 3 Bedrooms and Full Bath, while Unit 3 is a bright Studio with brand-new Kitchen and beautifully renovated Full Bath. Units 1 & 2 have new in-unit washers/dryers; all units feature new flooring and fresh paint. The partially finished, heated Basement offers potential for a 4th unit (do your due diligence), with separate side/rear entrances, plumbing and laundry already in place. The boiler and hot water heater have been replaced with brand-new high-efficiency on-demand wall units. Level backyard, oversized driveway with ample parking and detached 2-car Garage. All units are leased through mid-2027. Rents include heat, hot water, gas, water, garbage, snow removal, grounds and exterior maintenance. Unit 1 includes Garage use. A compelling investment with immediate income, significant upgrades and built-in value-add potential!",
